# Claude Code
.claude/

# Research scratch — working files fetched or dumped while investigating a device.
#
# Never publish these. Several are third-party vendor files redistributed
# verbatim (MediaTek kernel headers, powerhint/scentbl XMLs, command tables);
# others are dumps derived from a third party's binary. The *facts* learned from
# them live in docs/protocol.md, with sources named — that is the part worth
# keeping, and it is ours to publish.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `src/` also matches
# `mtk-optimizer/app/src/`, which silently keeps the app's own new source files
# out of the repository.
/_*
/tmp/
/g*.json
/gh*.json
/hdrs/
/src/
/s_*.xml
